# Installed to /etc/sudoers.d/islandr-proxy (mode 0440, root:root).
# Scoped sudoers per ADR-0011: the islandr user may run exactly wg and nft as
# root, nothing else. Argument shaping is enforced by islandr-proxy's allowlist,
# not here (sudoers arg-globbing is brittle); the real gate is the daemon.
#
# Network diagnostics (ADR-0025, net_ping/net_tracepath) deliberately have no
# entry here: ping/tracepath run directly as the islandr-proxy user, no
# elevation, on a modern Linux host — see the Executor.Run doc comment in
# handler.go for why.
#
# Paths are distro-dependent — verify with `command -v wg nft` and adjust.
# Debian/Ubuntu: wg=/usr/bin/wg, nft=/usr/sbin/nft.
islandr ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/wg, /usr/sbin/nft
